@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-13  Preview and accept a personal roadmap
' Requirements: PROFILE-01 ROAD-01 ROAD-02 ROAD-03 ROAD-04 ROAD-05 ROAD-06 ROAD-07 ROAD-08 PROGRESS-03 REC-01 AI-05 AI-06 DATA-01 P-04 P-05
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Student" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
U -> S: Request roadmap for chosen career or learning goal
note over U,S
Apply shared saved-outcome rules (diagram index / FC-07).
Resolve accessible success before new-generation checks:
no generation or extra usage, even at 20 used or during outage.
Permissions, privacy, deletion/expiry and current catalog apply.
end note
alt No accessible saved success and new generation cannot proceed
  S --> U: Explain unmet condition; keep current plan unchanged
else Saved success retrieved, or new generation succeeds under FC-07
  alt Catalog cannot provide a suitable complete plan
    S --> U: Explain catalog gap; retain current plan
  else Suitable proposed plan
    S --> U: Preview saved or new proposal with ordered courses and reasons
    opt Weekly hours and all unfinished-course estimates are available
      S --> U: Show approximate weeks; no deadlines or penalties
    end
    alt Student does not accept
      S --> U: Keep existing active plan, if any
    else Student explicitly accepts or confirms replacement
      U -> S: Accept proposed roadmap
      alt This roadmap is already the Student's active plan
        S --> U: Return current plan; do not repeat replacement
      else Proposal is no longer accessible or eligible
        S --> U: Refuse acceptance; keep current plan; require an eligible proposal
        note over U,S
        Recheck at acceptance, including archived unstarted courses.
        A revised proposal requires another preview and acceptance.
        end note
      else Active roadmap changed since preview
        S --> U: Keep current plan; require fresh preview and replacement confirmation
      else Proposal remains eligible and confirmation is current
        S --> U: Set as the one active roadmap; show completion progress
        note over S
        Preserve prior course attempts, completions, and badges.
        Completed included courses count toward this plan.
        Roadmap progress displays 100% only when every
        included course is complete.
        Rounding keeps unfinished progress below 100%.
        Unstarted courses use latest revision when later started.
        Profile or assessment changes do not auto-replace the plan.
        end note
      end
    end
  end
end
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-13 | Product behavior
@enduml
